    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92314" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥευσ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in a state of flux, flowing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					121.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					207
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.217
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; of time flowing away, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				3.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>fluctuating, unsettled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.268d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλισθηρὰν καὶ ῥ. εἰς ἅπαντα
				τὴν πολυπραγμοσύνην ποιοῦντες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				522a
			</span></i>.</div>
